0 98 0 UberASM Object 98\nFree Vertical Scroll\nMakes the camera follow Mario up and down.
0 99 0 UberASM Object 99\nLock Horizontal Scroll\nPrevents the camera from scrolling left or right.
0 9A 0 UberASM Object 9A\nInvisible Mario\nMakes Mario invisible.
0 9B 0 UberASM Object 9B\nNo Power-ups\nPrevent Mario from collecting any power-ups, including to the item box. Can be used to reset power-up state.
0 9C 0 UberASM Object 9C\nEnable 8-frame Cape Float\nApply a consistent 8 frame counter after the input is registered to adjust Mario's falling speed with cape.
0 9D 0 UberASM Object 9D\nRemove Cape Float Delay\nSet the delay before Mario starts floating with cape to zero frames.
0 9E 0 UberASM Object 9E\nDisable Cape Flight\nPrevents Mario from ever entering flight with cape.
0 9F 0 UberASM Object 9F\nDeath on Power-up Loss\nLosing a power up will kill Mario instantly. Makes all hurt blocks death blocks and all damaging sprites lethal.
0 A0 0 UberASM Object A0\nPress L & R To Die\nKills the player if L and R are pressed. Useful for a quick reset.
0 A1 0 UberASM Object A1\nDisable Screen Shake\nStops all Vanilla sources of Layer 1 screen shake.
0 A2 0 UberASM Object A2\nDisable Spin Jump\nDisables the A Button, therefore no spin jumping.
0 B0 0 UberASM Object B0\nSet Retry Type to Instant\nMake the retry skip using prompt and restart instantly after dying.
0 B1 0 UberASM Object B1\nSet Retry Type to Prompt\nSet the retry system to use a prompt that says "Retry" in the middle of the screen.
0 B2 0 UberASM Object B2\nSet Retry Type to Vanilla\nSet the retry system back to using Vanilla death routine.
0 B3 0 UberASM Object B3\nBottom Left Retry Prompt\nMove the "Retry" prompt to the bottom left if Prompt Retry is active (by default it's in the middle).
0 B4 0 UberASM Object B4\nNo Power Ups from Midways\nDisable gaining a power-up (mushroom) from a midway point.
0 BA 0 UberASM Object BA\nDisplay Sprite Timer\nShow the level timer from the Retry System's sprite status bar.
0 BB 0 UberASM Object BB\nDisplay Coins Counters\nShow the coin counters from the Retry System's sprite status bar.
0 BC 0 UberASM Object BC\nDisplay Item Box\nShow the item box from the Retry System's sprite status bar
0 C0 0 UberASM Object C0\nStart with a Mushroom\nHave the player start the level with a Mushroom.
0 C1 0 UberASM Object C1\nStart with Cape\nHave the player start the level with a Cape.
0 C2 0 UberASM Object C2\nStart with Fire Flower\nHave the player start the level with a Fire Flower.
0 C3 0 UberASM Object C3\nStart with Star Power\nHave the player start the level with Star Power. Not infinite, lasts as long as a normal Star.
0 C4 0 UberASM Object C4\nStart on Green Yoshi\nHave the player start the level on a Green Yoshi.
0 C5 0 UberASM Object C5\nStart on Yellow Yoshi\nHave the player start the level on a Yellow Yoshi.
0 C6 0 UberASM Object C6\nStart on Blue Yoshi\nHave the player start the level on a Blue Yoshi.
0 C7 0 UberASM Object C7\nStart on Red Yoshi\nHave the player start the level on a Red Yoshi.
0 C8 0 UberASM Object C8\nStart in Spin Jump State\nHave the player start the level spinning (most useful when Mario is in the air).
0 C9 0 UberASM Object C9\nStart in OFF State\nStarts the level with the ON/OFF state in the OFF state.
0 CA 0 UberASM Object CA\nStart in ON State\nStarts the level with the ON/OFF state in the ON state.
0 D0 0 UberASM Object D0\nToggle Statusbar\nPlacing the object hides the Layer 3 statusbar.
0 D1 0 UberASM Object D1\nToggle Screen Scroll\nDisable the effects of a patch that prevents scrolling the screen with L or R.
0 D2 0 UberASM Object D2\nToggle Spin Jump Fireballs\nPrevent Mario from shooting fireballs while spin jumping.
0 D3 0 UberASM Object D3\nToggle Block Duplication\nDisable the effects of a patch that prevents block duplication.
0 D4 0 UberASM Object D4\nToggle Springboard Fixes\nDisable the effects of a patch that prevents re-grabbing kicked springboards and them zeroing your speed when grabbed. (Enabling spring midairs).
0 D5 0 UberASM Object D5\nToggle Cape Turnaround\nDisable the effects of the patch that makes turning around with cape consistent on button press.
0 D6 0 UberASM Object D6\nToggle Rope Glitch\nToggle off the fixes for the air climb rope glitch.